# Environment loaded into local `act` runs. This overrides act's default `.env`
# auto-load (see .actrc: --env-file=.env.act). Kept intentionally minimal: the
# service-free CI jobs (quality, audit, build) get every value they need from
# the workflow-level and step-level `env:` blocks in .github/workflows/ci.yml.
#
# The point of this file is to STOP act from slurping the real, gitignored
# ./.env (your local dev secrets) into the runner container on every run.
#
# Add a line here only if you want that value visible to every local act job.
